Task 1: Create a new post using POST:-

POST
Request URL

https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts

Steps in Postman
1. Open Postman and create a new HTTP request.
2. Select the POST method.
3. Enter the URL above.
4. Open Body → raw → JSON.
5. Enter this JSON:

{
  "title": "My First API Test",
  "body": "This post was created using Postman.",
  "userId": 1
}

Task 2: Update the post using PUT:-
PUT
Request URL

https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/101

Replace 101 with the ID from Task 1.

Steps
1. Change the method to PUT.
2. Enter the URL using your post ID.
3. Select Body → raw → JSON.
4. Enter the updated data:

{
  "id": 101,
  "title": "Updated API Test",
  "body": "The title and body were updated using PUT.",
  "userId": 1
}
